<h2>Seat Outlet BBB: what this page can and cannot tell you</h2>
<p>Shoppers who search for Seat Outlet BBB are usually trying to check that a ticket marketplace is legitimate before they pay. That is a smart habit. This Seat Outlet BBB page does not quote a rating, grade or accreditation status from the Better Business Bureau. Instead, it lays out the commitments we make to customers so you can judge them for yourself.</p>
<p>If you want to verify any business independently, you can search for it directly on the <a href="https://www.bbb.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Better Business Bureau website</a> and read what is listed there, including complaints and how they were resolved. For background on what the organization is and how it works, see the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Better_Business_Bureau" target="_blank" rel="noopener">overview of the Better Business Bureau on Wikipedia</a>.</p>

